        "message": "=<p>Halo Manager,</p><p>Ada pengajuan cuti baru yang membutuhkan persetujuan Anda:</p><ul><li><strong>Nama:</strong> {{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json.Nama_Lengkap }}</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> {{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json['Email Karyawan'] }}</li><li><strong>Tanggal:</strong> {{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json['Tanggal Mulai'] }} s.d {{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json['Tanggal Selesai'] }}</li><li><strong>Total Durasi:</strong> {{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json.durationRequested }} Hari</li><li><strong>Alasan:</strong> {{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json['Alasan/Keterangan'] }}</li></ul><p>Silakan klik keputusan Anda:</p><p><a href=\"https://n8n-tlqlb7hcg5mz.jkt1.sumopod.my.id/webhook-test/approval-cuti?status=approved&email={{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json['Email Karyawan'] }}&days={{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json.durationRequested }}&id={{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json.requestId }}\" style=\"background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 15px; display: inline-block;\">✅ SETUJUI</a><a href=\"https://n8n-tlqlb7hcg5mz.jkt1.sumopod.my.id/webhook-test/approval-cuti?status=rejected&email={{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json['Email Karyawan'] }}&days={{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json.durationRequested }}&id={{ $('Validasi Cuti').item.json.requestId }}\" style=\"background-color: #f44336; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\">✖️ TOLAK</a></p><p><small>Pastikan workflow Approval Handler sedang aktif (Execute) saat tombol diklik. Link ini menggunakan environment TEST.</small></p>",
